  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peaceful and Accountable Democratic Process for a Cohesive Kenya - Mulika Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program is a faith-based, civil society-led cohesion and election oversight.program which will improve accountability and transparency in electoral and.democratic processes; and enhance citizen resilience against political.manipulation.</narrative>
  </description>
